=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mbopijzNLDYQ7kNvwH9q9IY&_nc_oc=AdoJLrSST_EhMTxTYNcUKB7KRfFRf69voyxxlQyKaRuIsl3T9knDpG5RwrhEOhwC_60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTm7_3FIrHW_eL4my8RM9AU_g6MM0kpIGcTkWM7I5ba_A&oe=6B04636A"}, {"file_name": "scr_5.png", "id": "1792868194748689", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_1792868201415355_9209451541789283250_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-yNr4yK23NkQ7kNvwEYEo3J&_nc_oc=Adr9WXfSrD8hw3VOTqwIO0xUzAzXdF1puCBrQ1Rd-ZnhiIqbuTQ36pu1q8k9R0BNH04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTkn_t_WZciIDCsDQi2l5HEpUqT6IEDmUhEYgOdWqFpdA&oe=6B047483"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cute & Dead", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You might look like a typical nerd, but even a zombie apocalypse won't stop you from asking the hottest girl in school out on a date.\nAll you need to do is find her and rescue her from hordes of the living dead. \n\nFight a variety of enemies, explore locations, and dance the night away. \nNot just for fun, but to save the world.\n\n**Features**\n\n- 30 unique girlfriends to meet and save\n- 8 unique maps to explore\n- 8 different enemy types\n- 10 weapon varieties - from improvised gadgets to powerful gear\n- A cute dog companion who fights by your side\n- Fast-paced, dynamic gameplay\n- Dance at the club and meet the most attractive girls from your school\n\nBattle the living dead, explore dangerous locations, save the girls, and prove that even nerds can be heroes!", "short_description": "You might look like a typical nerd, but even a zombie apocalypse won't stop you from asking the hottest girl in school out on a date.\nAll you need to do is find her and rescue her from hordes of the living dead. \nFight a variety of enemies, explore locations, and dance the night away. \nNot just for fun, but to save the world."}]}, "developer_name": null, "develop